Feature: ShoppingCart

  A minimal spec used to show SpecBinder's build-log diagnostics. Compile this
  module (mvn test-compile) with verbosity = VERBOSE to see per-class and
  per-feature processing detail printed by the annotation processor.

  Scenario: Add an item and check the subtotal
    Given I have an empty shopping cart
    When I add "Wireless Headphones" with quantity "2" and unit price "59.99"
    Then the cart subtotal should be "119.98"
